            "component": "Column",
            "children": ["hint", "btn"]
          },
          {
            "id": "hint",
            "component": "Text",
            "text": "theme.primaryColor='E91E63' 缺少 # 前缀，规范要求以 # 开头。引擎应回退默认 #00BFFF（浅蓝），下方按钮应为浅蓝而非品红。",
